# There is very little to ignore here. Do NOT add "vendor/": assets/vendor holds
# the committed copy of KaTeX that the blog needs to render math, and
# tools/vendor holds the copy of PyYAML that build.py needs to read content/.

### Python byte cache, created when build.py imports the vendored YAML reader ###
__pycache__/
*.pyc

